OL,3,GNEWSAHeat raises costs and cuts crop
OL,4,Ayields for farmers
OL,5,
OL,6,FAssistant Minister for Environment,
OL,7,FAgriculture and Fisheries Kirsten Morel
OL,8,Fsaid the government was keen to speak
OL,9,Fto farmers and could look at
OL,10,Freprioritising funds from its rural
OL,11,Fsupport scheme.
